Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ca-Cari yang paling murah pun,\Nuang jajanku tetap enggak cukup...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kalau ditambah\Nbiaya makan dan oleh-oleh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi bokek!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gi-Gimana ini?\NUang tahun baru juga sudah habis...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah sudah mandi duluan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah masak kari, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Ayah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau minta uang saku duluan,\Nnanti aku enggak bisa ngapa-ngapain lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus mengumpulkan poin\Nuntuk cari uang tambahan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.11,0:00:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu kok kelihatannya capek?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi banyak kerjaan,\Njadi agak keteteran, nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya enak.\NTerima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu lagi capek begini,\Nenggak enak kalo ngomongin uang, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.23,0:02:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan! Pagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini ada kelas jam pertama, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi lihat apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kepikiran mau kerja paruh waktu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sini coba lihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:03:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maunya kerja yang terjangkau kartu kereta\Ndan jadwalnya bisa disesuaikan sama kuliah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya lagi enggak banyak\Nlowongan seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja 3 sampai 4 hari seminggu,\N6 jam sehari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan jadwal kuliah tahun pertama,\Nkayaknya susah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau butuh jadwal fleksibel,\Nmau kutanyakan ke ayahku?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya! Keluarga Yacchan\Npunya swalayan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.69,0:03:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Emang enggak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sendiri enggak mau bantu\Nkarena enggak suka swalayan, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah ayahku bakal terbantu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau banget! Tolong, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja paruh waktu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Awalnya bakal berat\Nkarena banyak yang dipelajari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi katanya, kerja paruh waktu pertama\Ndi swalayan itu bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau ke swalayannya Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begini, aku bisa\Nmengumpulkan uang ke Nagasaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf! Kemarin ayahku\Nsudah menerima anak tetangga,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi tinggal sif malam...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh! Apes banget momennya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau cuma untuk nabung wisata,\Nkerja harian juga cukup 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Iya juga!\NAku kadang juga kerja harian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja harian itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja paruh waktu dalam satu hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misalnya jadi staf konser atau figuran.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya menarik!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada peralatan yang mau kubeli juga,\Nmau kerja bareng?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ajak teman sekarang,\Nnanti kita dapat voucer belanja.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini kerja gudang, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar melakukan\Nbanyak pekerjaan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gudangnya luas, jadi takut tersesat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak usah tegang begitu,\Nnanti pasti diajari, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, kerjaan begini nambah cerita baru.\NUntungnya dobel 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahan cerita?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Jadi ini cerita pas aku\Nkerja paruh waktu di gudang..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio punya cita-cita\Nselain jadi T-tuber ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan kayak gitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya, mohon berkumpul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku enggak sanggup\Nmengangkat tangan lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Stamina Misaki payah banget, ya.\NPadahal pekerjaan hari ini ringan, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau jadi staf konser bakal pegal-pegal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena harus menahan orang-orang\Nyang berdesakan maju.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai hari ini, mohon kerja samanya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mo-Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seragamnya cocok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seragam Usa lebih imut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, ini panduan pekerjaannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, pelajari dulu\Npekerjaan di dalam toko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sudah terbiasa dan lancar,\Nbaru mulai melayani pelanggan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau terbiasa melakukan pekerjaan rumah,\Nkurasa enggak akan sulit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di awal, perlu belajar bersih-bersih,\Nmemasak makanan sederhana,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}cara membuat minuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu belum boleh minum alkohol,\Njadi bagian ini mungkin agak rumit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minuman yang paling sering kami sajikan itu\Nshochu campuran dan bir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, cara memakai dispenser bir ini ada\Ndi halaman 234 buku panduan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf sudah menunggu.\NSilakan, Koktail Ekspres Waku Waku Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mungkin enggak bisa\Ndapat pekerjaan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, jangan begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak perlu sedih begitu cuma\Ngara-gara gagal di satu atau dua pekerjaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.95,0:07:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya! Aku juga dulu payah\Nwaktu pertama kali kerja paruh waktu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya...\NTernyata Ushio juga dulu begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat banget pulihnya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya! Kemarin aku tanya ke tempat kerjaku,\Napa mereka lagi cari pegawai baru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beda divisi, tapi kalau di sini,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu bisa langsung kerja\Nsetelah kelas selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pramugari... kereta ekspres?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu berangkat ke kampus,\Npernah lihat kereta Red Arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernah! Aku pernah\Nhampir salah naik sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kereta yang harus beli tiket ekspres dulu\Nbaru boleh naik, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul! Nanti tugasnya memeriksa\Ntiket ekspres penumpang di dalam kereta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seragam ini kayaknya\Nbakal cocok sama Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari segi waktu bisa diatur\Nsetelah selesai kelas, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kalian jadi repot-repot\Nbegini karena aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di saat seperti ini, Kodama justru senang\Nkalau kamu bilang terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik! Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan coba melamar\Npramugari kereta ekspres!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu diterima,\Nkita semua bakal naik kereta itu, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kalau bisa, tunggu\Nsampai aku terbiasa dulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh kami tahu alasan\NAnda melamar pekerjaan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:09:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, se-seragam yang ada\Ndi poster terlihat lucu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, belakangan ini saya lebih memperhatikan\Norang-orang yang bekerja di stasiun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya menyadari kalau mereka\Nbangga dengan pekerjaannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat saya melihat mereka berusaha\Nagar penumpang menikmati perjalanan...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.87,0:09:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya pun ingin menjadi orang dewasa\Nyang keren seperti mereka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Anu, jadi kalau ada kesempatan,\Nsaya ingin mencobanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau diterima bekerja,\Nkira-kira kapan Anda bisa mulai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kalau bisa, sesegera mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah ukuran seragamnya pas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mo-Mohon bimbingannya mulai hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namaku Sata Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku Kamii Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon kerja samanya\Nselama enam hari ke depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enam hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum mulai bertugas,\Nkamu akan mengikuti berbagai pelatihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di hari terakhir, kamu akan naik\Nkereta Red Arrow untuk mengikuti tes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu lulus, kamu akan bertugas sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Secepat itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, selagi kita masih bekerja bersama,\Nsebisa mungkin tanya yang belum paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Baik! Mohon bimbingannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini aku bakal berjuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kursi mana saja yang sudah dibeli\Ndan diduduki oleh penumpang
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa dilihat melalui tablet ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kursi yang berwarna ini berarti\Nsudah dipesan dengan tiket ekspres.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah kereta berangkat,\Nperiksa layar ini dulu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk memastikan penumpang\Nduduk di kursi sesuai tiket mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pernah hampir naik\Ntanpa tiket ekspres.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ada penumpang salah naik,\Napa yang harus aku lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang tidak enak bilangnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi penumpang itu harus\Ndiminta beli tiket ekspres.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanyakan stasiun tujuan\Ndan carikan kursi yang tersedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, terima pembayarannya\Nmelalui kembalian yang ada di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, hanya bisa pembayaran tunai, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar. Ada juga penumpang yang belum tahu,\Njadi jelaskan baik-baik, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada pertanyaan lain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang susah memahami semuanya\Nkalau belum mencoba langsung, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya, tapi waktunya cuma sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku khawatir kalau terjadi sesuatu\Nsaat aku kerja sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berusaha mendampingimu\Nsebisa mungkin, jadi ayo semangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah paham cara menggunakan tablet, 'kan?\NBarang-barangmu lengkap?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tablet, tas, pulpen... Lengkap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:12:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kereta Red Arrow ini menuju\Narah berlawanan dari arus pulang kerja.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini kita harus memeriksa\Nsemua kursi berdua saja,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi mari berusaha\Nmengeceknya dengan cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, apa yang harus kita lakukan pertama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, memastikan apakah ada penumpang\Ndi kursi yang ditandai warna...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tepat. Sekarang, ayo kita periksa, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, baris pertama... baris kedua...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon maaf mengganggu,\Nboleh kami memeriksa tiket ekspres Anda?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon maaf, kursi yang Anda pesan\Nada di 1 baris di depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius? Oh, iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kursi ini akan ditempati penumpang lain.\NMohon kesediaannya untuk pindah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf... Aku benar-benar\Ntidak bisa diandalkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini baru pertama kali.\NWajar kalau kamu masih bingung!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana caranya\Nbisa cekatan seperti Kamii...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sama sekali enggak bisa\Nmembayangkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagi penumpang, kita semua profesional.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penumpang enggak tahu siapa yang masih baru\Ndan siapa yang sudah berpengalaman, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kita terlihat cemas,\Npenumpang akan khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi saat sedang murung,\Ntetaplah tersenyum dan introspeksi dalam hati.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu bisa lakukan itu hari ini,\Nmaka nilainya sempurna!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tekad yang bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, kalau begitu,\Nayo kita periksa tiket ekspres.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada tips untuk mencocokkan\Nkursi dengan tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin lebih cekatan\Ndi stasiun berikutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya. Aku contohkan sekali.\NPerhatikan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, lihat letak warna\Npada tablet sekilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Sekilas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah ingat letaknya,\Nlangsung lihat kursi-kursinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat adakah kepala penumpang di posisi\Nyang sesuai dengan tampilan tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, pas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, sambil berjalan,\Npastikan posisi kursi benar
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:15:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan hitung jarak kursi kosong\Ndi antara penumpang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari penumpang ini\Nke penumpang berikutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu, dua, tiga...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesuai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, ayo lanjut\Nke gerbong berikutnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, coba Sata\Nyang memimpin pemeriksaannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hon-Kawagoe di sini...\NKota Sayama di sini...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.91,0:15:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, hari ini tes praktik untuk menentukan\Napakah Anda siap bertugas sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.67,0:15:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemarin kamu melakukan bagian terakhir\Ndengan sempurna, pasti baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo semangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon kerja samanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda melayani penumpang\Ndengan sangat sopan, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sata hebat sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Anu, saya ingin memeriksa\Ngerbong sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Per-Permisi, Tuan!\NKita sudah sampai di Higashimurayama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita sudah sampai di Higashimurayama.\NTerima kasih telah menggunakan layanan kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat! Kok Sata bisa menyadarinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Anu, saya melihat penumpang tertidur\Nsesaat sebelum tiba di Higashimurayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi saya memastikannya\Ndia akan turun di mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kalau saya yang di posisinya,\Npasti sudah kebablasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ter-Ternyata kebiasaan\Nceroboh saya ada gunanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sata...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda menanganinya dengan sangat baik,\Nmohon kinerja baik ke depannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat, Sata! Kamu lulus, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Be-Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong mulai bekerja sendiri\Nmulai dari jadwal kerjamu berikutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?! Apa saya bisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sata pasti bisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hore! Hore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya akan berusaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ha-Halo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh iya, Sata.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong cek sif bulan depan dan gajimu.\NHarusnya sudah masuk hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gaji pertamaku sebanyak ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sebanyak ini,\Naku bisa beli ini dan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, apa yang kupikirkan?\NIni uang wisata.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua,\Nterima kasih telah bekerja keras!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini, Ayah masak semur daging, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, hari ini Ibu sepertinya pulang terlambat.\NKalian makan duluan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal Ibu ingin makan semur daging spesial\Nbuatan Ayah bersama kalian...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Aku pulang! Masih belum tidur?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, karena ada sesuatu\Nyang ingin kuberikan pada Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tada! Masker mata hangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Dapat dari mana ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baru gajian hari ini, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu bergadang karena sibuk,\Nsetidaknya aku ingin Ibu tidur lebih nyaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bukannya Misaki nabung\Nuntuk biaya wisata?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:19:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga ingin Ibu sehat seperti halnya\Naku ingin pergi berwisata.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Ibu, selamat datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hadiah dari gaji pertama Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki hebat banget, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}U-Untuk Papa ada enggak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, hadiah buat Papa bulan depan, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu! Aku ikut bareng!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Pagi banget, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sif pagi pertamaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Keren banget, ya.\NKayak petugas profesional.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pas banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keren! Tabletnya juga keren!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Semangat, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya. Anu, terima kasih sudah\Nmenggunakan layanan kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan menikmati perjalanan\Ndengan nyaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Permisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, Ushio di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, dia enggak bangun seperti biasa,\Njadi aku tinggal saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih telah\Nmenggunakan layanan kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati dalam perjalanan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Subtitle provided by:\NYuramedia Link
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penerjemah: Rasyid Yudhanto Kurniawan\NTiming: Bayu Surya Perdana\NPemeriksa Akhir: Nail Basalamah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ulang sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.53,0:22:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.29,0:22:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kalau boleh tahu, mana yang salah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, soal itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanan itu cuma pemicu\Nagar pelanggan naik kereta, mungkin itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.29,0:22:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu. Tur kuliner mewah\Nmakan sepuasnya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku membayangkan dari sudut pandangku,\Naku maunya ikut tur seperti ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jejeng! Pertanyaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa daya tarik Kereta Api Matsuura\Nyang kita ketahui dari tur ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Makanannya enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:22:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:23:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi daya tarik kita bukan cuma itu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat persiapan acara di Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu bilang ingin para pengunjung\Ntahu lebih banyak hal lagi, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan memikirkannya sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama, kenapa tidak\Nmembangunkanku hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kasih tahu sif Misaki selanjutnya,\Naku bakal balas dendam!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.39,0:23:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, bangunkan aku hari itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ih!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.73,0:23:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, "Cuaca di Sana Bagaimana?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi aku harus bangun pagi...
